        "original_id": "8c333070-1c75-512a-a7b9-f9896fe6b6ab",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tony Richardson, Giorgio Ferroni, Peter Strauss\n- Roles: theatre director, film director, producer, film editor, screenwriter\n- Works: Penalty Phase\n- Topics: English cinema, Italian cinema, American television films\n\nFacts:\n- Giorgio Ferroni was born on April 12, 1908, and he became an Italian film director, film editor, and screenwriter.\n- Tony Richardson was born on June 5, 1928, and he became an English theatre and film director and producer whose career spanned five decades.\n- Giorgio Ferroni was sometimes credited as Calvin Jackson Padget or Calvin J. Padget.\n- Penalty Phase is a 1986 American television thriller-drama film directed by Tony Richardson and starring Peter Strauss.\n- Giorgio Ferroni died on August 17, 1981.\n- Tony Richardson died on November 14, 1991.",
